# C组：应用菜单与API资源。仅为示例；不会自动执行。
# 将同目录 http-client.private.env.example.json 复制为 http-client.private.env.json。
# 只在私有文件填写账号/密码/密钥和测试对象ID；在IDEA选择coursework-local环境。
# 私有文件已被Git忽略，请不要把真实凭据填进本.http文件。

### C01 查询应用列表
GET {{base}}/api/v1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### C02 查询应用菜单
GET {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{appId}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### C03 查询应用API
GET {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{appId}}/apis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### C04 查询菜单关联API ID
GET {{base}}/api/v1/menus/{{menuId}}/apis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### C05 新建应用
POST {{base}}/api/v1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appCode": "DEMO_APP",
  "appName": "演示应用",
  "status": 1
}

### C06 修改应用
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{appId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appName": "演示应用新名称",
  "status": 1
}

### C07 新建菜单或目录
POST {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{appId}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuCode": "DEMO_MENU",
  "menuName": "演示菜单",
  "menuType": 2,
  "parentId": "{{parentDeptId}}",
  "path": "/demo",
  "status": 1
}

### C08 修改菜单或目录
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{appId}}/menus/{{menuId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuName": "更新菜单",
  "menuType": 2,
  "parentId": "{{parentDeptId}}",
  "path": "/demo",
  "status": 1
}

### C09 新建API资源
POST {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{appId}}/apis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiCode": "DEMO_API",
  "apiName": "查看演示",
  "apiPath": "/demo/items/{id}",
  "httpMethod": "GET",
  "status": 1
}

### C10 修改API资源
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{appId}}/apis/{{apiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiName": "查看演示",
  "apiPath": "/demo/items/{id}",
  "httpMethod": "GET",
  "status": 1
}

### C11 完整保存菜单接口关联
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/menus/{{menuId}}/apis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiIds": [
    "{{apiId}}"
  ]
}
